{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>To sanctify it, as He commanded you.</b> In the same manner that He commanded you at Marah (Exodus 15:26) — for indeed, when He commanded you there concerning the Sabbath, He made known that it would not suffice for you to sanctify it merely by refraining from labor, but that you must engage in it with Torah and mitzvot, as it says: וְהַיָּשָׁר בְּעֵינָיו תַּעֲשֶׂה וְהַאֲזַנְתָּ לְמִצְוֹתָיו (Exodus 15:26)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:20:37.278362500Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}